 REM queue\failed\ when it exits with any other code (issue 1194).
 cd /d "%~dp0"
 title VS job queue
-if exist watcher_b.bat start "" /min "%~dp0watcher_b.bat"
+if not "%~1"=="--locked" if exist watcher_b.bat start "" /min "%~dp0watcher_b.bat"
